{"id":6170705260,"name":"Blending Simulator 2 🥛","desc":"Welcome to Blending Simulator 2! \n🥛 Build your own smoothie factory and make all kinds of smoothies. Sell your smoothies to customers to earn money and xp. Buy new blenders to make more and better smoothies! Level up to discover new ingredients and expand your plot! 🥛\n\n👍 If you enjoyed playing the game, feel free to leave a like! 😇\n\n- Private servers have a 250 jar limit and jars have an extra 10 second lifetime to allow for even bigger factories!","path":"/game/6170705260-blending-simulator-2","slug":"6170705260-blending-simulator-2","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/9ace3aac883575943bc969f7139cf948e2a811a3d3f4d989a79a916ca3ff8897.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-598aa3bfee158fd5dce33cb86395f571/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":6,"visitor":10065870,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-04-08T17:05:40.160Z","creator":{"name":"Blend Productions","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":1},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"622fb815c45b1e6d09a30d2c","title":"Infinite Backpack script","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c782d9","gameId":6170705260,"name":"Blending Simulator 2 🥛","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"slug":"6170705260-blending-simulator-2","path":"/game/6170705260-blending-simulator-2","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":6170705260},"slug":"Blending-Simulator-2-Infinite-Backpack-script-1272","verified":true,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":86464,"executes":60,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-script.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/f3ae85e1351d9132e7be52455e34dbb6/500/280/Image/Jpeg","scriptblox":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/f3ae85e1351d9132e7be52455e34dbb6/500/280/Image/Jpeg"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-script.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/f3ae85e1351d9132e7be52455e34dbb6/500/280/Image/Jpeg","scriptblox":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/f3ae85e1351d9132e7be52455e34dbb6/500/280/Image/Jpeg"},"likeCount":2,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2022-03-14T21:48:05.898Z","updatedAt":"2022-03-14T21:48:05.898Z","lastBump":"2022-03-14T21:48:05.898Z","script":"getgenv().zone = 10 --change this to the latest zone you have unlocked\n\nfunction EmptyBackpack()\n\nlocal plot\nfor i,v in pairs(game.Workspace.Plots:GetChildren()) do\nif (v.PlotOwner.Value == game.Players.LocalPlayer.Name) then\nplot = v\nend\nend\n\nlocal blender\nfor i,v in pairs(plot.PlacedItems.Blenders:GetChildren()) do\nblender = v\nbreak\nend\n\nlocal args = {\n    [1] = blender.BlendMenuOpener\n}\n\ngame:GetService(\"Players\").LocalPlayer.PlayerGui.ScreenGui.BlenderMenu.Blend_Menu:FireServer(unpack(args))\nend\n\n\n\nfunction getItems()\n   local before = game.Players.LocalPlayer.Character.HumanoidRootPart.CFrame\n   for i,v in pairs(game.Workspace.Areas:GetChildren()) do\n      if (v.Area_Lvl.Value == getgenv().zone) then\n         for a,b in pairs(v.Items:GetChildren()) do\n            game.Players.LocalPlayer.Character.HumanoidRootPart.CFrame = b.Hitbox.CFrame\n            wait(.1)\n         end\n      end\n   end\n   running = false\n   game.Players.LocalPlayer.Character.HumanoidRootPart.CFrame = before\n   EmptyBackpack()\nend\n\n        running = false\n        while (wait(.1)) do\n                if running then\n                    getItems()\n                end\n        mouse = game.Players.LocalPlayer:GetMouse()\n        mouse.KeyDown:connect(\n            function(key)\n                key = string.lower(key)\n                if key == \"v\" then\n                    running = true\n                end\n            end\n        )\n        end","features":"Keybind: V -> you cant move after\nJoin a game, farm a lot of items, leave or tp to a blender interaction, rejoin or exit the interaction, and you should be able to move\nor simply during the blending animation","tags":["infinite","farm"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"61ae3534dbec4f0207211d48","username":"Emptyness","verified":true,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"status":"offline","id":"61ae3534dbec4f0207211d48","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.views","tier":1000000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-24T03:01:42.281Z","last":"","win":14,"math":4},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"67e5e1e1b360710ec3c4b001","editBy":{"_id":"61ae3534dbec4f0207211d48","username":"Emptyness","status":"offline","id":"61ae3534dbec4f0207211d48"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2022-03-16T08:46:45.929Z"},{"_id":"67e5e1e4b360710ec3c4ef33","editBy":{"_id":"61ae3534dbec4f0207211d48","username":"Emptyness","status":"offline","id":"61ae3534dbec4f0207211d48"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2025-03-27T22:54:42.489Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"623102efd199b8039fef4ddf","commentBy":{"_id":"61a926c98b4e467adb2353df","username":"BadChuKun","verified":true,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"createdAt":"2021-12-02T20:04:25.234Z","lastActive":"2026-03-30T10:32:33.983Z","status":"offline","id":"61a926c98b4e467adb2353df","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":5},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"text":"Pretty good tho 100% press V next to ur blender when you see E button prompt","createdAt":"2022-03-15T21:19:43.439Z","edited":true,"likeCount":1,"liked":false,"disliked":false}]},{"_id":"62506b646d68679f38dd41d7","title":"Script for","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c782d9","gameId":6170705260,"na